# Code-only repository: ignore files unless explicitly allowed below.
# Keep directories traversable so new source files can be discovered.
*
!*/

# C/C++ and Python source code
!*.c
!*.h
!*.cpp
!*.hpp
!*.cc
!*.hh
!*.cxx
!*.hxx
!*.inl
!*.py

# Build scripts and project files
!*.ps1
!*.bat
!*.cmd
!*.sh
!*.cmake
!CMakeLists.txt
!Makefile
!requirements*.txt
!pyproject.toml
!*.spec
!*.sln
!*.vcxproj
!*.vcxproj.filters
!*.vcxproj.user
!*.props
!*.targets
!*.dev

# Shared editor settings, documentation and licensing
!**/.vscode/*.json
!*.md
!/.gitignore
!**/.gitignore
!/.gitattributes
!/.editorconfig
!/LICENSE
!/NOTICE

# Resources and generated directories stay local.
# These exclusions also cover source-like files inside generated output.
/资源备份/
**/pic/
**/.vs/
**/.venv/
**/venv/
**/__pycache__/
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.mypy_cache/
**/build/
**/dist/
**/dist_onefile/
**/build_onefile/
**/build_exe/
**/build_od/
**/build_of/
**/_internal/
**/output/
**/_export/
**/VS/x64/
**/VS/visual_simu/
**/单文件版/

# Generated files with source-like extensions
Makefile.win
*.tmp.*
*.bak.*
